<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan spring crop seedings 92 pct complete.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan spring crop seedings 92 pct complete.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seeding of Saskatchewan's spring crops was 92 percent complete by Sunday, compared with 65 percent a week earlier, 75 percent at this time last year and the five-year average of 85 percent, Saskatchewan Agriculture said.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
